  "workload": "One real-top CMDQ 16x16 Matrix GEMM (descriptor k_words=16) and one M=16 banked CNM GEMV execute concurrently using disjoint SPAD input/output ranges. Matrix operands contain uniform INT8 +1; every output is 64. CNM vectors use INT8 +2 and +3; every output is 96.",
  "measurement_boundary": "VCS Top command/profile window through CPLQ-tail observation using +define+VCS behavioral four-bank SPAD. The 10 ns clock is a simulation setting. This is neither ASIC timing/PPA nor TinyNPU comparison.",
  "traffic_definition": "Accepted engine-interface data only: Matrix banked read/output line counts as 16 bytes; CNM accepted per-lane read/scalar write counts as 4 bytes. Excludes descriptor/completion traffic, host initialization/readback, and DMA.",
  "cycle_definition": "Exclusive phase buckets partition Matrix and CNM busy cycles exactly; engine_overlap_cycles and request_collision_cycles are concurrent event counts and may overlap those buckets. Request/response wait observer counters may overlap; do not sum them a second time.",
